      "name": "adidas Hyperglam Training Leggings - Women's",
      "description": "<p>Keep your energy high and your style on point with the adidas Hyperglam leggings. These full-length leggings feature Climacool technology to wick away sweat, keeping you dry during intense boutique gym classes or casual hangouts. The high-rise design and smooth, front-seam-free finish provide a flattering look that moves with your lifestyle effortlessly.<br><br>• Climacool technology wicks and disperses moisture for a cool feel</br>• Exposed elastic waistband with linear logo provides a secure fit</br>• High-rise design offers a supportive and flattering silhouette</br>• Smooth finish with no front seam reduces distractions</br>• Interlock knit fabric provides a sleek and comfortable feel</br><br><b>Material & Care</b><br>• 85% recycled polyester/15% elastane</br>• Machine wash</br><br><b>Size and Fit</b><br>• Tight fit for a body-hugging feel</br>• Ankle length</br>• High waisted</br>• Stretch level: Stretch</br></p>",
